,"code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" and the SDK"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentationMode.wrappedValue.dismiss()"},{"type":"text","text":" by default. Otherwise you must perform the dismissal of the paywall."}]}]},{"name":"onErrorView","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A completion block that accepts an ","type":"text"},{"code":"Error","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and returns a ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". This will show when the requested","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"paywall is skipped. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"EmptyView()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"feature","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A completion block containing a feature that you wish to paywall. Access to this block is remotely configurable via the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/superwall.com\/dashboard","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". If the paywall is set to "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Non Gated"}]},{"type":"text","text":", this will be called when"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the paywall is dismissed or if the user is already paying. If the paywall is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Gated"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", this will be called only if the user is already paying","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or if they begin paying. If no paywall is configured, this gets called immediately. This will not be called in the event of an error.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Superwall\/getPaywall(forPlacement:params:paywallOverrides:delegate:)"},{"ty